commit 4d316823ebcd3a079d84622ce322fd7fc83e3958
Author: Uladzimir Klyshevich <istin2007@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun Oct 4 13:13:10 2026 +0300

    fix(sm): review #701 follow-ups — self-tick --repo scoping + active-SM guard, guest rework cap, smJiraSource in run_all

    Addresses all four PR #701 review findings:

    - mergeBot self-tick repo scoping (BLOCKING): the end-of-run dispatch now
      appends '--repo <owner>/<name>' (reusing action()'s parsed owner/name) —
      bare 'gh workflow run machine-sm.yml' resolved the CWD's repo, wrong in
      multi-repo runners. test_mergeBot asserts the verbatim command.

    - SM-tick amplification: the self-tick fired on EVERY deferring bot run,
      even while a machine-sm.yml run was already queued/running → tick storms
      during healthy waves. New hasActiveSmRun() probe (smAgent
      hasActiveTargetWorkflowRun semantics: queued/in_progress/waiting/pending,
      >6h zombie queued ignored, all-runs path fallback on workflow-id 404)
      skips the dispatch with '⏭️ self-tick skipped (SM already active)'.
      Tests: in_progress and queued block the tick; a stale zombie queued run
      does not.

    - Unbounded guest rework cycle: the 2026-10-04 guest validation-red arm is
      now capped at guestReworkMaxAttempts (default 2, jobParams override).
      Prior arms are counted via the '🔁 guest rework arm N/MAX (owner
      directive 2026-10-04)' marker appended to each guest fail report —
      per-PR, NOT per-head (every rework pushes a new head; a per-head count
      would reset each lap and never cap). At N >= MAX: no agent:rework arm,
      the report says rework attempts are exhausted and the coordinator owns
      the PR, and the run logs '🛑 guest pr-N rework cap reached (N/MAX) —
      coordinator owns it from here'. Machine-author paths stay
      uncapped/unchanged.

    - test_smJiraSource.js registered in run_all.json (same shape as siblings,
      next to test_mergeBot.js).

    Tests: test_mergeBot 24/24 (was 22), test_smAgent 245/245 (was 242),
    test_smJiraSource 3/3, run_all 1434 passed / 2 failed — both
    agentDocsCoverage git-ls-files failures pre-exist identically on the base
    commit (runner env lacks git on PATH).

